OL,3,GNEWSADoctor accused of examining
OL,4,Apatients with blood-stained gloves
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor has been accused of examining
OL,7,Fpatients with blood-stained gloves.
OL,9,FDr Syeda Siddiqui is due to face a
OL,10,Fmisconduct tribunal after being
OL,11,Finvestigated by the General Medical
OL,12,FCouncil (GMC), which regulates the
OL,13,Fregister of doctors able to practise in
OL,14,Fthe UK.
OL,16,FDr Siddiqui is alleged to have examined
OL,17,Ftwo patients on 7 August 2024 at the
OL,18,FCommunity Health and Eyecare Ltd Clinic
OL,19,F(CHEC) in Warrington, Cheshire, with
OL,20,Fnon-sterile gloves contaminated with
OL,21,Fthe blood of a previous patient.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
